+Call(Name("car_race_collision"), Int(N))	semantics/syntax.k:9,12,28; semantics/core.k:131-154,194; semantics/call.k:19-21,69-75	Name lookup selects the module-scope closure; the Int literal evaluates; the one argument is evaluated left-to-right; a frame is allocated and n is bound.
